  "vv83:0.3": "",
  "vv83:0.4": "1207. 9. Maṭṭhakuṇḍalīvimānavatthu ",
  "vv83:1.1": "‘‘Alaṅkato maṭṭhakuṇḍalī , ",
  "vv83:1.2": "māladhārī haricandanussado; ",
  "vv83:1.3": "Bāhā paggayha kandasi, ",
  "vv83:1.4": "vanamajjhe kiṃ dukkhito tuva’’nti. ",
  "vv83:2.1": "1208. ‘‘Sovaṇṇamayo pabhassaro, ",
  "vv83:2.2": "uppanno rathapañjaro mama; ",
  "vv83:2.3": "Tassa cakkayugaṃ na vindāmi, ",
  "vv83:2.4": "tena dukkhena jahāmi jīvita’’nti. ",
  "vv83:3.1": "1209. ‘‘Sovaṇṇamayaṃ maṇimayaṃ, ",
  "vv83:3.2": "lohitakamayaṃ atha rūpiyamayaṃ; ",
  "vv83:3.3": "Ācikkha me bhaddamāṇava, ",
  "vv83:3.4": "cakkayugaṃ paṭipādayāmi te’’ti. ",
  "vv83:4.1": "1210. So māṇavo tassa pāvadi, ",
  "vv83:4.2": "‘‘candimasūriyā ubhayettha dissare; ",
  "vv83:4.3": "Sovaṇṇamayo ratho mama, ",
  "vv83:4.4": "tena cakkayugena sobhatī’’ti. ",
  "vv83:5.1": "1211. ‘‘Bālo kho tvaṃ asi māṇava, ",
  "vv83:5.2": "yo tvaṃ patthayase apatthiyaṃ; ",
  "vv83:5.3": "Maññāmi tuvaṃ marissasi, ",
  "vv83:5.4": "na hi tvaṃ lacchasi candimasūriye’’ti. ",
  "vv83:6.1": "1212. ‘‘Gamanāgamanampi dissati, ",
  "vv83:6.2": "vaṇṇadhātu ubhayattha vīthiyā; ",
  "vv83:6.3": "Peto kālakato na dissati, ",
  "vv83:6.4": "ko nidha kandataṃ bālyataro’’ti. ",
  "vv83:7.1": "1213. ‘‘Saccaṃ kho vadesi māṇava, ",
  "vv83:7.2": "ahameva kandataṃ bālyataro; ",
  "vv83:7.3": "Candaṃ viya dārako rudaṃ, ",
  "vv83:7.4": "petaṃ kālakatābhipatthayi’’nti. ",
  "vv83:8.1": "1214. ‘‘Ādittaṃ vata maṃ santaṃ, ",
  "vv83:8.2": "ghatasittaṃva pāvakaṃ; ",
  "vv83:8.3": "Vārinā viya osiñcaṃ, ",
  "vv83:8.4": "sabbaṃ nibbāpaye daraṃ. ",
  "vv83:9.1": "1215. ‘‘Abbahī vata me sallaṃ, ",
  "vv83:9.2": "sokaṃ hadayanissitaṃ; ",
  "vv83:9.3": "Yo me sokaparetassa, ",
  "vv83:9.4": "puttasokaṃ apānudi. ",
  "vv83:10.1": "1216. ‘‘Svāhaṃ abbūḷhasallosmi, ",
  "vv83:10.2": "sītibhūtosmi nibbuto; ",
  "vv83:10.3": "Na socāmi na rodāmi, ",
  "vv83:10.4": "vata sutvāna māṇavāti. ",
  "vv83:11.1": "1217. ‘‘Devatā nusi gandhabbo, ",
  "vv83:11.2": "adu sakko purindado; ",
  "vv83:11.3": "Ko vā tvaṃ kassa vā putto, ",
  "vv83:11.4": "kathaṃ jānemu taṃ maya’’nti. ",
  "vv83:12.1": "1218. ‘‘Yañca kandasi yañca rodasi, ",
  "vv83:12.2": "puttaṃ āḷāhane sayaṃ dahitvā; ",
  "vv83:12.3": "Svāhaṃ kusalaṃ karitvā kammaṃ, ",
  "vv83:12.4": "tidasānaṃ sahabyataṃ gato’’ti . ",
  "vv83:13.1": "1219. ‘‘Appaṃ vā bahuṃ vā nāddasāma, ",
  "vv83:13.2": "dānaṃ dadantassa sake agāre; ",
  "vv83:13.3": "Uposathakammaṃ vā tādisaṃ, ",
  "vv83:13.4": "kena kammena gatosi devaloka’’nti. ",
  "vv83:14.1": "1220. ‘‘Ābādhikohaṃ dukkhito gilāno, ",
  "vv83:14.2": "āturarūpomhi sake nivesane; ",
  "vv83:14.3": "Buddhaṃ vigatarajaṃ vitiṇṇakaṅkhaṃ, ",
  "vv83:14.4": "addakkhiṃ sugataṃ anomapaññaṃ. ",
  "vv83:15.1": "1221. ‘‘Svāhaṃ muditamano pasannacitto, ",
  "vv83:15.2": "añjaliṃ akariṃ tathāgatassa; ",
  "vv83:15.3": "Tāhaṃ kusalaṃ karitvāna kammaṃ, ",
  "vv83:15.4": "tidasānaṃ sahabyataṃ gato’’ti. ",
  "vv83:16.1": "1222. ‘‘Acchariyaṃ vata abbhutaṃ vata, ",
  "vv83:16.2": "añjalikammassa ayamīdiso vipāko; ",
  "vv83:16.3": "Ahampi muditamano pasannacitto, ",
  "vv83:16.4": "ajjeva buddhaṃ saraṇaṃ vajāmī’’ti. ",
  "vv83:17.1": "1223. ‘‘Ajjeva buddhaṃ saraṇaṃ vajāhi, ",
  "vv83:17.2": "dhammañca saṅghañca pasannacitto; ",
  "vv83:17.3": "Tatheva sikkhāya padāni pañca, ",
  "vv83:17.4": "akhaṇḍaphullāni samādiyassu. ",
  "vv83:18.1": "1224. ‘‘Pāṇātipātā viramassu khippaṃ, ",
  "vv83:18.2": "loke adinnaṃ parivajjayassu; ",
  "vv83:18.3": "Amajjapo mā ca musā bhaṇāhi, ",
  "vv83:18.4": "sakena dārena ca hohi tuṭṭho’’ti. ",
  "vv83:19.1": "1225. ‘‘Atthakāmosi me yakkha, ",
  "vv83:19.2": "hitakāmosi devate; ",
  "vv83:19.3": "Karomi tuyhaṃ vacanaṃ, ",
  "vv83:19.4": "tvaṃsi ācariyo mamāti. ",
  "vv83:20.1": "1226. ‘‘Upemi saraṇaṃ buddhaṃ, ",
  "vv83:20.2": "dhammañcāpi anuttaraṃ; ",
  "vv83:20.3": "Saṅghañca naradevassa, ",
  "vv83:20.4": "gacchāmi saraṇaṃ ahaṃ. ",
  "vv83:21.1": "1227. ‘‘Pāṇātipātā viramāmi khippaṃ, ",
  "vv83:21.2": "loke adinnaṃ parivajjayāmi; ",
  "vv83:21.3": "Amajjapo no ca musā bhaṇāmi, ",
  "vv83:21.4": "sakena dārena ca homi tuṭṭho’’ti. ",
  "vv83:22.1": "Maṭṭhakuṇḍalīvimānaṃ navamaṃ. "
}
